# MasAR+ — Blender Files
This folder contains the Blender models and 3D assets created for MasAR+. The files are organized into separate folders to make them easier to find and manage.

## Folder Structure
### Assets
Contains the 3D assets used throughout the game, including gameplay objects for all three characters, collectible cards, and other supporting models.

### BuDaryah
Contains Bu Daryah's 3D character model.
### OmAlsaaf
Contains Om El-Saaf's 3D character model.
### Tantal
Contains Tantal's 3D character model.

## Notes
- The `.blend` files contain the editable Blender models.
- Keep the original Blender files so the models can be modified or updated when needed.
